---
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";
---

<section class="section">
	<header class="section-header stack gap-2 lg:gap-4">
		<h3>Why it matters</h3>
		<p>The mindset behind our goals.</p>
	</header>

	<div class="why-grid">
		<div class="box why-card stack gap-2">
			<Icon icon="terminal-window" color="var(--accent-regular)" size="2rem" gradient />
			<h2>Technological advancement</h2>
			<p>We build with the future in mind: AI, robotics, and automation are changing how people live and work. Our projects are practice for real-world systems that need to be accurate, efficient, and dependable.</p>
		</div>
		<div class="box why-card stack gap-2">
			<Icon icon="rocket-launch" color="var(--accent-regular)" size="2rem" gradient />
			<h2>Skills for tomorrow</h2>
			<p>Learning by building creates deep understanding—debugging, iteration, and tradeoffs. Those habits matter as much as the tools themselves, and they transfer to any technical field.</p>
		</div>
		<div class="box why-card stack gap-2">
			<Icon icon="heart" color="var(--accent-regular)" size="2rem" gradient />
			<h2>Passion-driven growth</h2>
			<p>Curiosity is our fuel. We explore technologies, test ideas, and keep improving because we enjoy the process—and because we want our work to be meaningful.</p>
		</div>
		<div class="box why-card stack gap-2">
			<Icon icon="strategy" color="var(--accent-regular)" size="2rem" gradient />
			<h2>Problem-solving mindset</h2>
			<p>We treat problems as systems. We break them down, test assumptions, and build solutions that are practical—something that works consistently, not just once.</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.section {
		display: grid;
		gap: 2rem;
	}

	.section-header {
		justify-self: center;
		text-align: center;
		max-width: 50ch;
		font-size: var(--text-md);
		color: var(--gray-300);
	}

	.section-header h3 {
		font-size: var(--text-2xl);
	}

	.box {
		border: 1px solid var(--gray-800);
		border-radius: 0.75rem;
		padding: 1.5rem;
		background-color: var(--gray-999_40);
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
	}

	.why-grid {
		display: grid;
		gap: 1.5rem;
	}

	.why-card h2 {
		font-size: var(--text-md);
	}

	.why-card p {
		color: var(--gray-400);
		font-size: var(--text-sm);
	}

	@media (min-width: 50em) {
		.section {
			grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
			grid-template-areas: "header header header header" "content content content content";
			gap: 3rem;
		}

		.section-header {
			grid-area: header;
			font-size: var(--text-lg);
		}

		.section-header h3 {
			font-size: var(--text-4xl);
		}

		.why-grid {
			grid-area: content;
			grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
			gap: 2rem;
		}

		.box {
			border-radius: 1.5rem;
			padding: 2rem;
		}

		.why-card h2 {
			font-size: var(--text-lg);
		}

		.why-card p {
			font-size: var(--text-md);
		}
	}
</style>
